WEBVTT

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:03.520
My passionate idol activities,

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.980
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.210
My name is Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.930
I'm your ordinary first-year middle school student.

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:16.450
My family runs a bento shop.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:20.080
One day, I went to see the top idol Kanzaki Mizuki's concert

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.960
and fell head over heels for her.

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:23.670
I can tell!

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:26.020
Ichigo has the scent of an idol!

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:32.350
And so, with my best friend Aoi, the idol professor, pushing me on,

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:36.470
I somehow managed to get accepted into the idol training school, Starlight Academy.

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:38.470
My Aikatsu finally started.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:44.480
Aikatsu is what we call our idol activities, the daily work of taking auditions and getting gigs.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:49.590
We use the Aikatsu cards to choose our own outfits and stages.

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:51.480
To performers, these cards are life itself.

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:56.300
Right after entering, Aoi and I had to compete against each other in an audition.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:59.980
Aoi won, and was able to get the job of being Mizuki-chan's temporary manager.

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:02.120
Th-Thank you very much!

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:06.340
The road to becoming an idol might be much harsher than I could've imagined.

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:28.300
Hi, signalize!

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:33.640
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:33.640
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.530
No, that's wrong

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.530
iie chigau yo

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:40.910
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:40.910
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:42.700
Do that signalize!

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:47.880
Something's starting to bubble up

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:47.880
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:51.840
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:51.840
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:55.380
So I'll believe in the present

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:55.380
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:01:55.720 --> 00:02:00.550
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:01:55.720 --> 00:02:00.550
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:01.890
Chance for me

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:07.190
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:07.190
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:11.400
It's just another challenge on the way

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:11.400
hora chousen matteru yo

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:16.320
Where are we headed?

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:16.320
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:20.070
Into a brilliant hope

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:20.070
mabushii kibou no nake e

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:27.330
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:27.330
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.710
Where we're headed

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.710
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.590
is into our hopes for the future

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.590
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:41.930
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:41.930
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:04.340
No matter how close you two are,

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:06.440
you won't be able to continue rising together.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:09.020
<i>Even if that's true,</i>

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:12.820
<i>I want to work hard with Aoi and move on together. {ha ha, inserting references}</i>

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:15.500
<i>I'm sure Aoi thinks that too.</i>

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:23.420
There's not enough time!

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:28.680
There are only 7 hours and 26 minutes left until I have to pick up Mizuki-chan.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.150
Don't you have to sleep?

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.020
Thanks, but I'm fine.

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.370
Now that I'm Mizuki-chan's manager,

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:41.900
I need to make sure I know everything about her.

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:47.120
I think you already know everything there is to know, though.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.420
I know that.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.510
But I still can't calm down.

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:55.530
If I were the one becoming Mizuki-chan's manager, I'd definitely be nervous.

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:57.750
She's a top idol, after all.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.480
She's not<i> just</i> a top idol.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:03.000
She's the top of the top of the top <i>of the top!</i>

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:06.380
If you ranked all of the idols in the shape of a pyramid,

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:11.140
Mizuki-chan would be the sole person at the top.

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:13.080
And where would we be?

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:14.900
The very bottom.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.750
I guess so.

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:20.530
For one thing, Mizuki-chan debuted in her fourth year of elementary school.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:24.810
She was a model in fashion magazines for elementary schoolers.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:28.950
Then, though nobody knows why, she stepped out of the spotlight for a year.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.330
Why?

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:33.280
Nobody knows. It really was a mysterious year.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:37.990
I think that something big must've happened to change Mizuki-chan that year.

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:39.550
I'm kind of curious!

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:42.580
And so, one year after the start of her hiatus,

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:45.900
Mizuki-chan unexpectedly entered Starlight Academy,

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:48.870
and once again debuted as an idol with perfect singing and dancing abilities.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:51.060
She jumped straight to being a top idol!

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:54.120
She was perfect right from her debut.

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.560
Mizuki-chan really is a prodigy.

00:04:57.220 --> 00:05:00.570
I thought so even after I saw her just that one time.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:03.930
Right. She truly is a prodigy.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:10.070
I wonder how Mizuki-chan is normally?

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:10.940
I wonder.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:15.200
She might be unexpectedly airheaded.

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:18.420
<i>Time to dig in!</i>

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.250
Or maybe a little bit of a glutton.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.340
I'll be able to tell for sure tomorrow.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.080
You're so lucky!

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:27.960
As an idol fanatic, I'm fired up.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:31.080
Anyway, if you already know that much about Mizuki-chan,

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:32.970
then you have nothing to worry about.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:34.280
Really?

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:36.230
Yeah, you'll do great.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:37.980
Thanks.

00:05:38.470 --> 00:05:40.620
Just make sure you don't oversleep.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:48.960
I overslept! Aoi? {fixed}

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:51.980
Sorry, did I wake you?

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:54.180
Oh, no.

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:57.810
Okay then, I'm off.

00:05:57.810 --> 00:05:59.740
Yeah, good luck!

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:07.250
So she'll be with Mizuki-chan all day...

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:09.000
I'm jealous...

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:13.080
Here at Starlight Academy

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:15.890
we also train managers for the top class idols.

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:21.030
This time, we'll have you work as Kanzaki Mizuki's temporary manager.

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:22.100
Yes.

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:25.320
This is a valuable opportunity to learn exactly what a top idol is.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:28.520
Be sure to be at the Mizuki Palace first thing tomorrow morning.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:29.900
Yes.

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:39.250
<i>So this is the rumored Mizuki Palace</i>,

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:42.200
<i>Mizuki-chan's private dorm.</i>

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:58.140
<i>I've heard about it before, but I never thought I'd be able to go inside.</i>

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:13.910
<i>It's still only five in the morning.</i>

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:18.940
<i>So that makes my first job of the day waking up a soundly sleeping Mizuki-chan?</i>

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:22.310
Good morning!

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:30.660
<i>Wow, I might even be able to see Mizuki-chan in her pajamas!</i>

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:35.040
<i>That's Mizuki-chan.</i>

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:44.800
Oh?

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:47.110
You're...

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.240
U-Um, I'm...

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:50.820
Kiriya Aoi.

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.460
Today's assistant manager, right?

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:54.070
Yes!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:58.580
I'm the regular manager, Tsukikage Honoka. Good to see you.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.340
Thank you for having me today.

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:02.580
Do your best today.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.580
Yes, I will!

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:13.050
<i>That's just like Mizuki-chan! She's already model walking first thing in the morning.</i>

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.090
Let's go.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:19.780
<i>There's no way I could stop myself from coming today!</i>

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:22.600
<i>But how should I get over there...</i>

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:29.960
Hey, what are you doing?

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:33.320
Excuse me, let me hide behind you for a bit.

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:53.130
Suzukawa-kun, what's wrong?

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:55.120
Nothing...

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:59.920
The trunk door was just left open.

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:03.880
Thank you.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.400
Whatever.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.370
<i>I got in!</i>

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:24.160
Here's today's schedule.

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:26.100
Go over it now.

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:27.670
Okay.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:34.220
<i>A recording session, a photo shoot, an interview...</i>

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:36.800
<i>A variety show, and a music show...</i>

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.760
There's that much?

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:43.260
Wow.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:53.400
'Morning!

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.400
Good morning!

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:59.660
Man, you're cutey craze today too.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.800
"Cutey craze"?

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.810
In other words, cutey craze

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:09.790
is just crazy cute scrambled up?

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:13.170
Industry lingo is pretty weird.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:15.500
Kiriya-san, get the bags.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:16.660
Ah, right away.

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:25.180
Ichigo, right?

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:28.560
G-Good morning...

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:43.450
What do you think you're doing here?

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:48.710
U-Um, I really, really wanted to be Mizuki-chan's manager...

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:50.240
Ichigo...

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:52.960
Hey, this isn't a game, you know.

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:55.820
Return to school right this instant.

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:57.580
Isn't it alright?

00:10:57.580 --> 00:10:59.470
Let's have her be my manager too.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:01.400
Mizuki...

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:04.020
The one who won the manager audition

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:05.470
was only Kiriya.

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:08.480
But Ichigo-chan is interesting.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.480
Interesting?

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:14.620
Help carry the bags from the car into the studio, okay?

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:17.560
Y-Yes! Thank you very much!

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:25.360
I didn't think you'd actually follow me.

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:29.640
I just couldn't miss seeing how 
Mizuki-chan is behind the scenes.

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:33.000
Though, I wonder what Mizuki-chan meant.

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:35.420
That I'm "interesting".

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.760
I think I kind of get it.

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:40.620
You two, get a move on!

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:42.640
Coming!

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:54.860
Then we'll now start the recording for "Move on now!"

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:57.100
Mizuki-chan, you good?

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:58.150
I'm good.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:00.700
Mizuki-chan's recording a song!

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:04.140
I didn't know they did recordings this early in the morning.

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:05.640
They usually don't.

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:08.760
It's hard to sing properly in the morning.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:10.460
Then, why?

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:11.540
Just watch.

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:13.160
Take one.

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:30.890
My heart is racing

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.380
Uncontrollably

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:38.350
Move on now to tomorrow

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:41.660
and fall in love

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:49.500
Watch me as I rise to the top

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:50.660
Whoa.

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:53.360
Good work, everyone!

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:56.460
Great job, perfect on your first try.

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:59.740
Thank you very much. 
I'll be leaving now.

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:04.680
Wow...

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:06.500
She really is a prodigy.

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:10.060
To Mizuki, it doesn't matter how early it is.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:12.440
She'll always give a perfect performance.

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:14.920
That's Mizuki for you.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:16.880
Good morning.

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:20.940
Bringing you the latest from the world of business, this is "Morning Business Satellite".

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:24.860
Today's guest commentator is Kanzaki Mizuki-san.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.700
Thank you for having me.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.700
The first topic of the day is the raise of the consumption tax.

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:33.080
What do you think of this news, Mizuki-san?

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:37.580
Let's see.  Listening to what the Prime Minister has said thus far,

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.900
there doesn't seem to be a clear use for the money.

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:42.000
He has said that it will only be used for social security purposes, but...

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.470
I can't understand this at all.

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:47.960
Is something gonna come out, is something gonna come?

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:50.970
Ah!

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:52.470
It came!

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:55.580
Hmm, let's see...

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:59.480
"Tell the story of the angriest you've been in your life!"

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:02.100
A story about getting angry?

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:06.360
I don't really get angry all that much.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:10.900
Yeah, I know! I can't even imagine what you'd be like when you're angry.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.660
Very cute!

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:19.380
Good! Now raise your chin just a bit... good!

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.840
She's too amazing.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:26.420
From singing to a news program to a variety show to modeling for a fashion magazine—

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:28.880
I can't believe she can do all that!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.140
She's not simply "doing" it.

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:35.960
She can make the exact same pose perfectly every single time.

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:46.280
Mizuki-chan!

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:46.280
She's beautiful!

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:48.520
Even her smile— {mmm, emdash}

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:50.780
even her handshake!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.910
Everything about her is perfect!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:55.860
She really is a prodigy at everything!

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:58.740
I wish I were a prodigy like her.

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:02.000
Mizuki isn't the kind of girl you two think she is.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.320
Huh?

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:08.550
Excuse me, but we need to get going soon.

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:10.800
Sorry about this.

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:13.800
What did she mean?

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:31.570
Today's coord will be...

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:34.840
This one, this and this,

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:36.320
and this one too!

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.960
Alright Mizuki, give it your all.

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:42.600
Right!

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:46.920
Could you hold on to this for me?

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:47.920
Of course!

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:21.560
She's the best!

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:22.350
Isn't she?

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:48.380
Mizuki-san, good work today.

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:50.190
Good job.

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:53.200
Thanks. See you later.

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:02.370
What an unbelievable day.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.460
Yeah...

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:05.700
I feel like I'll be able to sleep well tonight.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:08.500
Me too. I'm pretty tired.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:10.460
I wonder if it was because I was excited all day?

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:13.850
I'm sure that Mizuki-chan is even more exhausted though.

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:19.380
This is Mizuki-chan's...

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:21.340
I forgot to give it back!

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:25.740
I wonder if Mizuki-chan is still awake?

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:44.120
Sounds like she's up.

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:44.620
Yeah.

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:49.800
Mizuki-san.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:53.130
Ah, it's open.

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:55.600
Excuse us...

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:04.960
Huh? The floor is all worn out...

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:16.120
Ichigo, let's come back tomorrow.

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:17.080
Sure...

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:26.900
U-Um...

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:30.400
Well, you forgot this.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.780
Thanks for coming all this way.

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.520
Be sure to rest well tonight.

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:46.050
Y-Yes!

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:50.160
I can't believe she's practicing like that

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:52.960
after all the work she did today.

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:55.810
You two.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:57.200
You saw, right?

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:01.520
You know, Mizuki

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:04.560
isn't the prodigy you two think she is.

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:09.060
She just trains much harder than anyone else.

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:13.580
No one is born a perfect idol.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:15.580
Could it be...

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:19.020
The year before Mizuki-san's idol debut

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:22.380
when she didn't make any public appearances at all...

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:24.580
Was she doing intensive training all that time?

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:28.720
I haven't seen a single idol who's endured such training

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.600
other than Mizuki herself.

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:36.960
Hoshimiya, Mizuki said that she thought you were interesting.

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:40.840
I believe that she can see the possibilities laid out before someone like you,

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:43.020
a girl who could use a Special Appeal during the entrance audition.

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:46.280
But you understand, right?

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:49.620
In order to catch up to Mizuki...

00:21:50.260 --> 00:21:53.370
We need to put in even more effort than Mizuki-chan.

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:56.180
Aoi.

00:21:57.020 --> 00:21:59.000
I was naive.

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.380
I thought that it was because Mizuki-chan was a prodigy

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:04.260
that she was so good.

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:05.980
I thought so too.

00:22:05.980 --> 00:22:09.140
No matter how intense the training, we can do it too.

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:12.020
Let's aim to be become true top idols!

00:22:12.020 --> 00:22:13.880
Yeah, together.

00:23:55.860 --> 00:23:58.460
Our idol activities have only just begun!

00:23:58.460 --> 00:24:01.080
But Ichigo, it looks like you have your very first fan already!

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:03.790
Huh, really? I wonder what sort of person they are?

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:05.330
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:05.330 --> 00:24:06.710
Oh! My! Fan!

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:09.890
Always passionate, Idol Activities!

00:24:10.820 --> 00:24:12.730
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:24:14.070 --> 00:24:16.330
You'll be found if you hide in the back of a car.

00:24:16.330 --> 00:24:18.730
Ichigo, that's not really an aphorism.

00:24:18.730 --> 00:24:20.070
Then one more!

00:24:20.790 --> 00:24:22.830
To idols, special training is also life itself.

00:24:22.830 --> 00:24:24.870
We've got to give our best too.
